  "prefLabel": "Ncr 309.01 Data Sharing Agreements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 309.01 Data Sharing Agreements. Data sharing agreements with persons, state or federal agencies regarding protected species or exemplary natural communities shall be in the form of a written agreement.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ncr 300) #12980, eff 1-24-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr300.html"
